sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant C as Context Engine
    participant T as Tool Manager
    participant M as LLM Model
    
    U->>F: Send Query
    F->>O: Format Request
    
    O->>C: Get Context
    C-->>O: Return Relevant Context
    
    O->>T: Check Tool Requirements
    T-->>O: Return Available Tools
    
    O->>M: Send Prompt Package
    Note over M: Process with:<br/>- System Prompt<br/>- Context<br/>- Tools<br/>- Query
    
    M-->>O: Return Response
    
    alt Tool Use Required
        O->>T: Execute Tool
        T-->>O: Return Tool Result
        O->>M: Send Tool Result
        M-->>O: Return Updated Response
    end
    
    O->>F: Format Response
    F->>U: Display Response
